# Commit Message - Archive Lifecycle Guidelines

# Type: feat/fix/docs/update/archive + brief description
# 
# Archive Updates Required:
# [ ] [CHRONICLE]: Update docs/RESONAI_CHRONICLE.md executive summary
# [ ] [INDEX]: Update archive/ARCHIVE_INDEX.md counts/references  
# [ ] [BACKUP]: Archive original files (preserve emoji artifacts)
#
# Archive Policy: See CHAR/ECRR/ECRR_REPORTS/backup/ARCHIVE_POLICY.md
#
# Examples:
# feat/docs: Add beta launch milestone
# update/docs: Sync archive counts after consolidation
# archive: Move completed reports to milestone-reports/
#
# DO NOT modify backup files - preserve original formatting
# DO update both Chronicle AND Index together
# DO use ASCII-only formatting in active docs
